9
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:23,937
What am I gonna do?!

10
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:29,100
God bless you.

11
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,297
To be with joy,

12
00:00:56,380 --> 00:01:01,960
being ghosts or even fortresses Lady
sentiment was awarded to live by tragedy

13
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:06,657
Sometimes for the last day,

14
00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:10,637
from happily to hell The
result is that I destiny and

15
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:15,837
know what to

16
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:19,157
live That's how

17
