This switch.

26
00:02:27,340 --> 00:02:29,575
It must be the chair's recline button.

27
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:31,470
Of course.

28
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:35,038
This'll be my ticket out of
this nightmare situation.

29
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:40,324
That beast will catch sight of the seat
moving and shift its focus to go after it.

30
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:43,661
Then I'll grab the brooch
and rush to the cockpit.

31
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,078
What am I thinking?

32
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:48,097
I can't do something like that.

33
00:02:48,180 --> 00:02:49,060
It's madness.

34
00:02:49,420 --> 00:02:51,244
Talk about having a death wish.

35
00:02:52,340 --> 00:02:53,277
Trish, forget it.

36
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:55,301
I'll wait this out in the closet.

37
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:57,860
Have I lost it?

38
00:02:57,980 --> 00:03:00,333
It's like my body just acted on its own!

39
00:03:05,060 --> 00:03:06,472
This isn't making sense.

40
00:03:06,620 --> 00:03:10,444
I was determined to not press the
button, but then did it anyway.

41
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,830
Fine.

42
00:03:11,913 --> 00:03:12,743
I'm gonna go for it.

43
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,180
It's now or never.

44
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:17,320
All right, Trish.

45
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,397
Take your time.

46
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:21,700
Move nice and slow, like a Tai Chi master.

47
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:25,420
Almost there.

48
00:03:25,860 --> 00:03:26,977
Just two more meters.

49
00:03:27,060 --> 00:03:28,236
Slow and deliberate.

50
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:29,892
Your life depends on it.

51
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,820
It's coming this way!

52
