Shit, it already destroyed the seat,
which means no more reclining it.

53
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:40,060
Don't panic.

54
00:03:40,340 --> 00:03:42,164
Just make another seat recline.

55
00:03:51,660 --> 00:03:52,490
What?

56
00:03:52,573 --> 00:03:54,493
Why did it go after me and not the seat?

57
00:03:57,780 --> 00:03:58,898
What's this liquid?

58
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:02,777
Did that fleshy horror react
to it dripping to the ground?

59
00:04:02,860 --> 00:04:05,742
But why are my boots even
wet in the first place?

60
00:04:06,300 --> 00:04:08,337
All I did was push the recline button.

61
00:04:08,420 --> 00:04:10,655
So how the hell did they get drenched?

62
00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:15,130
Damn it!

63
00:04:15,213 --> 00:04:18,862
This is exactly why I didn't want
to go after that stupid ladybug!

64
00:04:18,980 --> 00:04:21,862
I should have just stayed
out of this altogether!

65
00:04:24,620 --> 00:04:25,960
Help me to drag me!

66
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,120
I'm going to die!

67
00:04:27,740 --> 00:04:28,570
Ahhhh!

68
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,390
What?

69
00:04:40,473 --> 00:04:42,100
My boot just fell off my foot.

70
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:46,140
It's like it slid around
and passed through my leg.

71
00:04:46,380 --> 00:04:48,340
I don't understand any of this.

72
00:04:49,140 --> 00:04:50,400
What just happened?

73
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:52,832
Here's your opportunity.

74
00:04:53,220 --> 00:04:54,400
Procure the brooch.

75
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,700
Quickly, Trish.

76
00:04:58,460 --> 00:04:59,290
Who's there?

77
00:04:59,373 --> 00:05:00,791
Who's speaking right now?

78
00:05:01,620 --> 00:05:03,480
Someone who's always been here.

79
00:05:05,260 --> 00:05:09,380
Since you were a little girl,
never once have I left your side.

80
00:05:10,180 --> 00:05:13,540
Now, Trish, I'm asking you
to retrieve that brooch.

81
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:17,429
You've already made
the decision, you know.

82
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:21,400
Protecting Giorno's hand
started you down this road,

83
00:05:21,660 --> 00:05:24,180
but your hesitation weakens you.

84
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:25,917
Act now.

85
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,529
What would you have me do?

86
00:05:27,900 --> 00:05:29,677
Tell me, Trish. I...

87
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:31,525
