But when it hits a still object, it
breaks apart like hamburger meat.

113
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:03,040
Are you actually me?

114
00:07:03,540 --> 00:07:04,660
I mean my essence.

115
00:07:04,940 --> 00:07:07,020
And did I really just do all this?

116
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:08,777
My boot slipping off my foot.

117
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:09,977
That doesn't matter.

118
00:07:10,060 --> 00:07:10,890
Not right now.

119
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:12,809
You've secured the brooch.

120
00:07:12,980 --> 00:07:15,840
Your deep determination
overcame your cowardice.

121
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:18,137
You are growing much stronger, Trish.

122
00:07:18,220 --> 00:07:20,360
Mentally and emotionally as well.

123
00:07:20,820 --> 00:07:21,938
It's lovely to see.

124
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,430
Listen.

125
00:07:23,780 --> 00:07:28,180
Your power is to transform any
matter into a malleable object.

126
00:07:28,580 --> 00:07:30,620
The power to make things soft.

127
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:33,940
Yet even more durable than diamonds.

128
00:07:37,500 --> 00:07:38,600
