Stay away!

135
00:07:52,260 --> 00:07:54,460
You're not getting in here! Get back!

136
00:08:03,860 --> 00:08:08,340
Shit, it managed to sniff me out all
the way back here. I'm... I'm dead.

137
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:11,949
I know I'm supposed to
be a stand user now,

138
00:08:12,060 --> 00:08:14,457
and I can use all of these
special powers or whatever.

139
00:08:14,540 --> 00:08:20,757
but what good are they this thing's
unstoppable its users already

140
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:24,600
dead for heaven's sakes nothing
can stop this murderous blob

141
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:31,977
you see this is why i asked
you to remain still earlier

142
00:08:32,060 --> 00:08:37,577
our primary duty should be
reaching but we went the

143
00:08:37,660 --> 00:08:40,697
other direction what are
you talking about journo's

144
