205
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:48,520
You must remain calm.

206
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:52,120
Just keep moving toward me, nice and slow.

207
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:02,390
What's this?

208
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:05,320
What the hell is this monster?

209
00:13:05,620 --> 00:13:07,337
It can't stop us from falling.

210
00:13:07,420 --> 00:13:10,773
We're about to get up close
and personal with the ground.

211
00:13:10,860 --> 00:13:13,037
Actually, we'd be lucky to hit the ground.

212
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:14,497
These engines are going to blow.

213
00:13:14,580 --> 00:13:15,698
How did it survive?

214
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:18,160
It was torn to pieces and evaporated.

215
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:20,460
Shit, that's right.

216
00:13:20,740 --> 00:13:23,093
The engine is located behind the closet.

217
00:13:24,140 --> 00:13:24,970
Oh no.

218
00:13:25,053 --> 00:13:29,017
A cell or two must have passed through
a crevice in the wall of the closet.

219
00:13:29,100 --> 00:13:32,924
It must be having a field day
feeding on the power of the engine.

220
00:13:33,180 --> 00:13:34,137
And now...

221
00:13:34,220 --> 00:13:36,140
We're gonna have to crash land.

222
00:13:36,420 --> 00:13:38,200
Aim for the Terranian Sea.

223
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:40,207
Prepare for a water landing.

224
00:13:40,380 --> 00:13:41,498
It's our only hope.

225
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,940
An emergency landing.

226
00:13:44,260 --> 00:13:48,907
Even if by some miracle we manage to land
on the water in one piece, then what?

227
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,962
It'll still try to hunt us down.

228
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:53,840
I can't find any weaknesses in this stand.

229
00:13:54,140 --> 00:13:55,140
It's unstoppable.

230
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,920
Slow and steady, Trish.

231
00:13:58,520 --> 00:13:59,360
Easy does it.

232
00:14:00,060 --> 00:14:02,472
Move like a tiger closing in on its prey.

233
00:14:02,820 --> 00:14:04,040
Calm and deliberate.

234
00:14:05,020 --> 00:14:05,850
Don't run.

235
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:08,456
Doing so will just invite its attack.

236
00:14:13,300 --> 00:14:14,420
What are you doing?

237
00:14:14,580 --> 00:14:15,597
Weren't you listening?

238
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:17,077
It's gonna latch onto you!

239
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:20,217
Yeah, you're damn right it
will, but what does it matter?

240
00:14:20,300 --> 00:14:22,777
The same thing will happen
even if I move like a slug.

241
00:14:22,860 --> 00:14:24,448
So why not take the gamble?

242
00:14:24,760 --> 00:14:27,642
Now get your ass back in
the cockpit, Butcherati!

243
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:29,941
You've completely lost your mind!

244
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,160
The door's not...

245
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:36,280
How the hell?

246
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:38,640
Miss Power. Don't tell me.

247
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,477
This girl is...

248
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:41,980
An emergency landing?

249
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:44,837
Sorry, but you've got the wrong idea.

250
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:48,697
If you want to live long enough to
see Sardinia with your own eyes,

251
00:14:48,780 --> 00:14:50,337
we've no choice but to...

252
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:51,940
Bust this death trap!

253
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:53,710
Wannabe!

254
00:14:55,380 --> 00:14:56,400
Spicy lady!

255
00:15:00,980 --> 00:15:03,580
What in the world? These powers.

256
00:15:03,940 --> 00:15:05,881
When did you get stand abilities?

257
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:10,545
The walls, the glass, everything
in here is elastic like rubber.

258
00:15:10,780 --> 00:15:14,517
It's pretty obvious by now that this
meatloaf from Hell has a need for speed.

259
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:16,740
Well, the bastard's in luck.

260
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:23,620
A plane falling from the sky
moves faster than a parachute!

261
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:33,120
Eat it! Bitch meat!

262
